{"strongs": "H5739", "word": "עֵ֫דֶר", "translit": "e.der", "root": "עדן", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "flock, herd", "definition": "I. עֵ֫דֶר noun masculine Gen 29:2 flock, herd (Late Hebrew id. ; Aramaic עַדְרָא ; on ᵐ5 Γαδερ Gen 35:16 ( = HCT v Gen 35:21 ) see Lag BN 76 f. , who assigns ׳ ע therefore, plausibly, to III. עדר ( ), as lagging, loitering ); — ׳ ע absolute Gen 32:17 (twice in verse) +, construct Song 4:1 +; suffix עֶדְרוֺ Isa 40:11 +; plural עֲדָרִים Gen 29:2 +, construct עֶדְרֵי Mic 5:7 +, etc.; — 1. flock: \\ \\ a. of sheep, צאֹן ׳ ע Gen 29:2 ( J ), Mic 5:7 , ׳ הַצ ׳ ע Joel 1:18 compare Gen 29:2 ; Gen 29:3 ; Gen 29:8 ; Gen 30:4 (all J ), 1Sam 17:34 ; Jer 51:23 ; Mal 1:14 || צאֹן Ezek 34:12 (simile), Prov 27:23 + בְּהֵמָה 2Chr 32:28 הָֽרְחֵלִים ׳ ע Song 6:6 = Song 4:2 (insert probably ׳ הָֽר ); sign of desolation Isa 17:2 ; Isa 32:14 ( מִרְעֵה ׳ ע ), Zeph 2:14 ; Jer 6:3 , of peace Jer 31:24 in simile also Mic 2:12 ; Jer 31:10 ; Ps 78:52 figurative of Israel Isa 40:11 ; Jer 13:20 (|| צאֹן ), יהוה ׳ ע v Jer 13:17 , so עֶדְרוֺ Zech 10:3 . \\ \\ b. of goats, הָעִזִּים ׳ ע Song 4:1 ; Song 6:5 . \\ \\ c. undefined Judg 5:16 ; Job 24:2 ; Song 1:7 . 2. herds, flocks and herds ; \\ \\ a. including sheep, cattle, etc., Gen 32:17 (4 t. in verse); Gen 32:20 (compare v. Gen 32:14 all E ). \\ \\ b. specifically בָקָר ׳ ע Joel 1:18 . — מִגְדַּלעֵֿדָר see above", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5841')\">BDB5841</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5739')\">H5739</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5840')\">BDB5840</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5842')\">BDB5842</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>עֵ֫דֶר</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Gen 29:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,29,2)\">Gen 29:2</ref></sup> <highlightword>flock, herd</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>; Aramaic <bdbarc>עַדְרָא</bdbarc>; on <look